post.description:
Read-only scan of the tenant's customers for duplicate
candidates. Never writes. Response shape::

    {
      "count": <int>,
      "duplicate_groups": [<group>, ...]
    }

Emails the work-order PDF to the given address via Resend.
body: { to?: str, subject?: str, message?: str }
Falls back gracefully with `sent=False, reason='resend-not-configured'` if RESEND_API_KEY absent.

AI-powered dosing recommendation.
body: { volume_gal: float, readings: { fc, ph, ta, cya, salt? } }
Returns { recommendations: [{chemical, amount_oz, reason}], warnings: [...] }.

Atomic per item. A single bad row does not abort the batch;
each row reports ``ok`` or ``error`` with detail. Cap 500 rows
(enforced by the Pydantic ``max_items``).

get.description:
4-tile aggregate for the portal landing.

Response shape::

    {
      "balance_due": 214.50,          # unpaid remaining on all open invoices
      "past_due": 89.00,              # subset of balance_due whose due_date < today
      "credit": 0.00,                 # overpayments across paid invoices
      "next_service": {               # or ``None``
        "date": "2026-08-05",
        "service_type": "Pool cleaning",
        "job_id": "…"
      },
      "breakdown": {
        "open_invoice_count": 3,
        "past_due_invoice_count": 1
      }
    }
